OL,3,APeople troll my DIY but they just spur
OL,4,Ame on
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt's hard to miss the explosion of DIY
OL,7,Fcontent that has hit our social media
OL,8,Ffeeds over the last decade.
OL,10,FFrom quick reels on how to fix cracks
OL,11,Fin walls, to complicated YouTube
OL,12,Ftutorials on building alcove seating
OL,13,Ffrom scratch, the internet is
OL,14,Fchock-a-block with seemingly endless
OL,15,Fhome improvement demos.
OL,17,FWhile DIY was once seen as more of a
OL,18,Fmale domain, female influencers are
OL,19,Finspiring a new generation of women to
OL,20,Ftake matters into their own hands.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
