OL,3,APeople troll my DIY but they just spur
OL,4,Ame on
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeanwhile, demand for female
OL,7,Fprofessionals is rising, while some
OL,8,Fwomen are changing careers to take up
OL,9,Ftrades which they see as more AI-proof
OL,10,Fthan their desk jobs.
